      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "GOLDEN FIRE NZ (7) has been a model of consistency of late and deserved her victory last start, scoring by 3.5 metres over 1660m at this track after taking full advantage of the pole position. Has to contend with a very wide draw this time. Won't find this any harder and she can salute once again. LUVARESCHS (9) finished fourth last start over 1660m at this track, beaten 8 metres, after a good win at this track the run prior. Meets a similar line up and she can figure in the finish. TOUGH SHAZ (2) has been thereabouts of late and is a great chance to break through. Good effort last time out when she finished fifth at this track over 1660m. STENO (8) comes here following a Group One ninth two weeks ago over 1660m at this track, beaten 18 metres by Eye Keep Smiling. Sure to prove hard to beat in this lineup.",
